 things.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/12/northwestern-corp-nwe-q4-2020-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"NWE 2021 Q1","e":"nwe","d":"2021-04-22","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Robert C. Rowe","x":"In Montana, things played out differently equally or in fact even more positively, but we did not see the substantial gas price increases in Montana.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/22/northwestern-corp-nwe-q1-2021-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"NWE 2021 Q3","e":"nwe","d":"2021-10-25","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Robert C. Rowe","x":"Our view is that under the tariff, the PCAM base may be reset outside of a rate case.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/25/northwestern-corporation-nwe-q3-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"NWE 2021 Q3","e":"nwe","d":"2021-10-25","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Crystal D. Lail","x":"We narrowed that down to $0.15 and have reaffirmed our guidance for '21 at $3.43 to $3.58 per diluted share.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/25/northwestern-corporation-nwe-q3-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"NWE 2022 Q2","e":"nwe","d":"2022-07-28","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Crystal Lail","x":"…slide 10, and note that, obviously, we noted in our press release and Bob noted is the open that we are reaffirming our guidance based off the performance in the first half of the year in line with our expectations and no changes to the slide as to the items that we expect to impact us in 2022.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/07/28/northwestern-nwe-q2-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NWE 2025 Q2","e":"nwe","d":"2025-07-31","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Brian Bird","x":"And, what we need to do ultimately is go arm and arm with these large load customers You go into the MPSC with a tariff that protects customers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/07/northwestern-energy-nwe-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NWE 2025 Q2","e":"nwe","d":"2025-07-31","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Brian Bird","x":"We have some time, and we plan to file in probably 26 tariffs with them to get service as a state regulated resource, if you will.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/07/northwestern-energy-nwe-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NWE 2025 Q4","e":"nwe","d":"2026-02-12","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Brian Bird","x":"And when we have an ESA with one of these parties, we would like to make a filing with the MPSC along with a large load tariff that protects customers, and we are going to do that here in 2026.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/12/northwestern-nwe-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NWE 2025 Q4","e":"nwe","d":"2026-02-12","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Brian Bird","x":"And also the South Dakota PUC has established process for large load customers with a deviated rate tariff.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/12/northwestern-nwe-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NWE 2026 Q1","e":"nwe","d":"2026-04-30","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Brian Bird","x":"From a regulatory and legislative standpoint, we have had constructive wildfire legislation passed in South Dakota, and we recently submitted a large new load tariff proposal with the MPSC.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/30/northwestern-nwe-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"NWE 2026 Q1","e":"nwe","d":"2026-04-30","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Brian Bird","x":"On slide 18, from a regulatory front in terms of large load customers, the big news this quarter is we submitted our large new load tariff with the MPSC in March 2026.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/30/northwestern-nwe-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"NWE 2026 Q1","e":"nwe","d":"2026-04-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Brian Bird","x":"Any cost savings that these two companies achieve ultimately accrue back to customers in future rate reviews.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/30/northwestern-nwe-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"NWE 2026 Q1","e":"nwe","d":"2026-04-30","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Crystal Lail","x":"Moving to slide 11, Brian noted that we are reaffirming our guidance for 2026.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/30/northwestern-nwe-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"NWE 2026 Q1","e":"nwe","d":"2026-04-30","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Crystal Lail","x":"In addition, critical to our long-term earnings profile—as we have discussed—are the developments related to our development agreements with Quantica and the large new load filing, all underpinning our ability to reaffirm our guidance over 2026 and beyond.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/30/northwestern-nwe-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"NWE 2026 Q2","e":"nwe","d":"2026-07-30","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Brian Bird","x":"Think you are also aware in March, of this year, we did submit our large new load tariff.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/07/northwestern-energy-nwe-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NWE 2026 Q2","e":"nwe","d":"2026-07-30","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Brian Bird","x":"We wanted to make sure that we were aware that we are trying to protect customers with this large load of tariffs, and we wanted to get that in front of the commission. it is there for people to see.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/07/northwestern-energy-nwe-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NWE 2026 Q2","e":"nwe","d":"2026-07-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Brian Bird","x":"Not only that, any benefits that are accrued for putting these two companies together from a cost savings perspective that will ultimately accrue to customers in future rate reviews.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/07/northwestern-energy-nwe-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NWE 2026 Q2","e":"nwe","d":"2026-07-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Brian Bird","x":"We wanna make sure we continue to be as efficient as we can and even more so on a merged basis to provide those cost-saving benefits to customers on a going-forward basis.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/07/northwestern-energy-nwe-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NWE 2026 Q2","e":"nwe","d":"2026-07-30","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Crystal Dawn Lail","x":"Moving to Slide 12, as Brian indicated, we are pleased with our start to 2026 and it is in line with our expectations, and we are reaffirming our guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/07/northwestern-energy-nwe-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NWE 2026 Q3","e":"nwe","d":"2026-11-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Crystal Dawn Lail","x":"Due to weak market prices overall, the PCAM tariff waiver provided no recovery of cost for the Avista portion during the quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/05/northwestern-energy-nwe-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NWE 2026 Q3","e":"nwe","d":"2026-11-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Crystal Dawn Lail","x":"In a similar fashion, on the quarter results, the PCAM tariff waiver related to the Avista portion tied to certain designated contracts has not resulted in recovery of costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/05/northwestern-energy-nwe-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NWE 2026 Q3","e":"nwe","d":"2026-11-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Brian Bird","x":"But any cost savings achieved from this merger ultimately going to accrue to customers in future rate reviews.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/05/northwestern-energy-n